  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2502.01 Mandatory Participation.\n\n(a) Nursing facility quality assessment taxpayers shall make tax payments by EFT.\n\n(b) Medicaid enhancement tax taxpayers shall make tax payments by EFT.\n\nSource. #6639, eff 11-27-97, EXPIRED 11-27-05\n\nNew. #8495, eff 11-30-05; ss by #10484, eff 12-5-13; amd by #12907, eff 10-23-19; ss by #13126-B, eff 10-24-20; ss by #13724, eff 8-18-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 2500)",
